    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Uva and Southern provinces during the evening or night. A few showers may occur in the coastal areas of the Eastern Province and the Mullaitivu District. Mainly dry weather will prevail over the other areas of the island. Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early hours of the morning. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
